[00:17.50]A couple of seasons passed me by
{"几个季节从我身边流逝"}
[00:21.69]since you made me feel so real
{"自从你让我感到如此真实"}
[00:25.67]That feeling I remember
{"那种感觉我仍记得"}
[00:29.61]it was as good as it can be
{"那是极致的美好"}
[00:33.49]I haven't seen you for a while
{"许久未曾与你相见"}
[00:37.69]I wonder if you are well
{"不知你是否安好"}
[00:41.56]What's going on in your mind
{"你心中正经历着什么"}
[00:45.60]I really would like to see
{"我真心想要知晓"}
[00:49.59]I try to see but it won't do
{"我试图看清却徒劳无功"}
[00:53.60]it's taking time to get near
{"靠近你需要时间发酵"}
[00:57.67]Something is hard to explain
{"有些事难以言表"}
[01:01.42]I wonder can I tell you
{"不知能否向你倾诉"}
[01:05.60]We haven't been talking much
{"我们近来交谈甚少"}
[01:09.42]it doesn't mean I don't care
{"不代表我不再牵挂"}
[01:13.03]Should I just call you to say
{"是否该拨通电话告诉你"}
[01:17.46]I'm falling and I miss you
{"我正在坠落并思念着你"}
[01:21.03]
[01:21.85]oooh hoo
[01:24.17]Wish I was with you in my dreams
{"多希望梦中与你相随"}
[01:28.10]and I'm praying to be by your side
{"我祈祷能守在你身旁"}
[01:33.65]and suddenly you'll slip away
{"你却突然消失不见"}
[01:37.91]oooh hoo
[01:40.14]Easy as flowing down the stream
{"如溪流般自然流淌"}
[01:44.12]Do you know that
{"你是否明白"}
[01:46.23]Will you understand me
{"能否理解我的心意"}
[01:49.81]Why is it you make me wait so long
{"为何你让我等待如此漫长"}
[01:53.50]
[02:09.87]Sometimes do you think of me
{"你是否偶尔也会想起我"}
[02:13.77]as much as I think of you
{"像我时常思念你那样"}
[02:17.67]I'd like to know when you dream
{"我想知道当你入梦时"}
[02:21.79]Am I there Do you miss me
{"我是否会出现　你是否也在想我"}
[02:25.57]I know you can't share life with me
{"我知道你无法与我共度此生"}
[02:29.10]and I don't know what to do
{"而我却不知该如何是好"}
[02:33.55]but if you walk right through my door
{"但若你此刻推门而入"}
[02:37.71]
